{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3ffa6c719530ed58acfffe8672f9f578b64a11fc6b1482d0c52efae653b00ab6","ja":"その銘柄のワインは……Aね！\nやったわ、これで全問正解♪","zh":"那个牌子的葡萄酒是……A呢！\n太好了，这样就全部答对了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"42ab61ec5b74166f20cd394dda0b46ae0ff423459dc1524a7b996d0672cdb011","ja":"ふふふ……アダルティ勝負なんて言い出すから、\nなにかと思ったら……利き酒勝負だったのね。","zh":"呵呵呵……你说要比一比谁更有成熟魅力，\n我还以为是什么呢……原来是比试品酒啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"88224497b351653272cda295227d326bd57811a2b0d58a9a3d655071df88d025","ja":"うう、私の負けね……。さすがこのみ姉さん……。\nあと全然酔ってないの、すご……。","zh":"呜呜，是我输了……不愧是好美姐……  \n而且居然完全没醉，真厉害……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ff30eb5d7b00eaff8043fca7f5df870d4f69b20130b5b4f9659d3ca8b4b43783","ja":"ふふ、莉緒ちゃんは酔いがまわってきたみたいね。\nでも珍しいわね、こんな勝負を持ちかけるなんて。","zh":"呵呵，莉绪好像已经有点醉了呢。  \n不过真少见啊，居然会提出这样的比试。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2e2857436ad80e0a06483b4a448392cb379afe1d4271a261847d28e771268319","ja":"らってぇ……私が最後潰れちゃうのわかってるから、\nこのみ姉さん、いつも遠慮して飲んでるでしょ……？","zh":"可是……因为知道我最后肯定会喝趴下，\n所以这个美姐每次都很克制地喝，对吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"85c2dfa299754e2d43e01cf8e62c50399820c4d8860abad302c8e17de7ee4b7a","ja":"最高のライブのあとくらい、気持ちよく\nぐいぐい飲んでほしいな～って……。","zh":"至少在最棒的演唱会之后，我想让你痛痛快快地喝个够～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"db043dabebf1ce91fc40e7a133ec641271718ebd6786294011daffbb79b90c3f","ja":"莉緒ちゃん……。\nそんなことを考えて……？","zh":"莉绪……。\n你在想那种事……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fc3f2c743834d6eabd967f782b9469bcd95951013d9aec2018483ee213d986d5","ja":"……はっ！？\n言っちゃった！","zh":"……啊！？\n说出来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d1947680d5728a90cf9a5f4c55ae1278ece2dd79eba1a53d485e18567da39d78","ja":"お、お酒のせいでうっかり……あ～ん！\nアダルティに決めるつもりだったのに～！","zh":"不、不小心都怪酒精……啊——！\n本来想走成熟路线的～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"33e21fcf616a17a9a76d7a60c28b540fa8c053bf2777134fc5867c9f2e653a5c","ja":"あっ！\n待って、莉緒ちゃん！","zh":"啊！\n等等，莉绪！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
